<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Plan Paulo">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0e0f0d">
<title>Plan Paulo · Recomposición</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
:root{
  --bg:#0e0f0d;--bg2:#161714;--bg3:#1e201c;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  --text:#e8e6de;--muted:#7a7a6e;
  --green:#c8f063;--orange:#f0a030;--red:#e05540;--blue:#5bbfef;
  --r:12px;
  --nav-h:60px;
  --safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
}
html{height:100%;overscroll-behavior:none}
body{
  font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
  font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;
  height:100%;
  overflow:hidden;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
}

/* ── HEADER ── */
.header{
  flex-shrink:0;
  background:var(--bg2);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:14px 18px 12px;
  padding-top:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px));
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
}
.header-logo{
  font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;
  font-size:22px;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:#fff;
}
.header-logo span{color:var(--green)}
.header-tag{
  font-size:11px;font-weight:500;
  background:rgba(200,240,99,0.12);
  color:var(--green);
  padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;
  letter-spacing:0.06em;
}

/* ── SCROLL AREA ── */
.scroll-area{
  flex:1;
  overflow-y:auto;
  overflow-x:hidden;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
  overscroll-behavior-y:contain;
}

/* ── BOTTOM NAV ── */
.bottom-nav{
  flex-shrink:0;
  background:var(--bg2);
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  display:flex;
  padding-bottom:var(--safe-bottom);
}
.bnav-item{
  flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:10px 4px 8px;
  cursor:pointer;gap:3px;
  transition:opacity 0.15s;
  border:none;background:transparent;
}
.bnav-icon{font-size:20px;line-height:1}
.bnav-lbl{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--muted);transition:color 0.2s}
.bnav-item.active .bnav-lbl{color:var(--green)}
.bnav-item.active .bnav-icon{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(200,240,99,0.6))}

/* ── PAGES ── */
.page{display:none;padding:20px 18px 32px}
.page.active{display:block;animation:fadeUp 0.3s ease}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}

/* ── HERO CARD ── */
.hero-card{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a2012 0%,#0e1a0a 100%);
  border:1px solid rgba(200,240,99,0.15);
  border-radius:16px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-card::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-40px;right:-40px;
  width:120px;height:120px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(200,240,99,0.15) 0%,transparent 70%);
}
.hero-name{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:38px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0.04em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:4px}
.hero-name span{color:var(--green)}
.hero-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px}
.hero-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
.hstat{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px}
.hstat-val{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:0.04em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:1px}
.hstat-lbl{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase}

/* ── SECTION TITLE ── */
.sec-eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:4px}
.sec-h{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:32px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0.03em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:16px}

/* ── CARDS ── */
.card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:12px}
.card-lbl{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;margin-bottom:6px}
.card-big{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:36px;letter-spacing:0.04em;line-height:1}
.c-green{color:var(--green)}.c-orange{color:var(--orange)}.c-red{color:var(--red)}.c-blue{color:var(--blue)}

.stat-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}

/* ── MACRO BAR ── */
.macro-wrap{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:12px}
.mbar{display:flex;height:8px;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0 10px}
.mb-p{background:var(--green)}.mb-c{background:var(--orange)}.mb-f{background:var(--red)}
.mlegend{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.mleg-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px}
.mdot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.mleg-val{font-weight:500}.mleg-sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-left:auto}

/* ── MENU CARDS ── */
.menu-card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden}
.menu-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.mico{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0}
.mico-g{background:rgba(200,240,99,0.12)}
.mico-o{background:rgba(240,160,48,0.12)}
.mico-b{background:rgba(91,191,239,0.12)}
.menu-info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.menu-time{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em}
.menu-name{font-weight:500;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3}
.menu-kcal{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:0.04em;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;text-align:right}
.menu-kcal-sub{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);display:block;letter-spacing:0.06em}
.menu-body{padding:14px 16px}
.menu-ing{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px}
.menu-macros{display:flex;gap:14px}
.mm{font-size:12px}.mm strong{color:var(--text);font-weight:500}
.menu-tip{font-size:12px;margin-top:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:rgba(200,240,99,0.05);border-left:2px solid var(--green);border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;color:#c0d0a0;line-height:1.5}
.menu-tip.o{background:rgba(240,160,48,0.05);border-left-color:var(--orange);color:#d0c0a0}
.menu-tip.b{background:rgba(91,191,239,0.05);border-left-color:var(--blue);color:#a0c0d0}

.menu-total{background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}
.mt-lbl{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.mt-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.mt-val{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:30px;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:0.04em;text-align:right}
.mt-macros{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;margin-top:2px}

/* ── TIP ── */
.tip{border-left:3px solid var(--green);background:rgba(200,240,99,0.05);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin:12px 0;color:#c8d4b0}
.tip.o{border-left-color:var(--orange);background:rgba(240,160,48,0.05);color:#d4c0a0}
.tip.r{border-left-color:var(--red);background:rgba(224,85,64,0.05);color:#d4a8a0}
.tip.b{border-left-color:var(--blue);background:rgba(91,191,239,0.05);color:#a0c8d4}

/* ── DAY ROWS ── */
.day-row{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:flex-start}
.day-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.day-tag{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.06em;width:46px;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1.2;margin-top:2px}
.day-content{flex:1}
.day-type{font-weight:500;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:3px}
.day-detail{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}

/* ── TABLE ── */
.tbl-wrap{overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:12px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--line)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
th{text-align:left;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.td-b{font-weight:500}

/* ── PILL ── */
.pill{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px}
.p-g{background:rgba(200,240,99,0.12);color:var(--green)}
.p-o{background:rgba(240,160,48,0.12);color:var(--orange)}
.p-b{background:rgba(91,191,239,0.12);color:var(--blue)}

/* ── CHECKLIST ── */
.cklist{list-style:none;padding:0}
.cklist li{padding:9px 0;font-size:13px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.cklist li:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.cklist li::before{content:"✓";color:var(--green);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}

/* ── WEEK CARDS ── */
.week-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}
.week-card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px}
.week-num{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.1em;margin-bottom:4px}
.week-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:4px}
.week-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}

/* ── ANTOJITOS ── */
.antojo-card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:10px}
.antojo-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}
.antojo-name{font-weight:500;font-size:15px}
.antojo-body{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}

/* ── INSTALL BANNER ── */
.install-banner{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(200,240,99,0.1),rgba(200,240,99,0.05));
  border:1px solid rgba(200,240,99,0.2);
  border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
}
.ib-icon{font-size:28px;flex-shrink:0}
.ib-text{font-size:13px;color:#c8d4b0;line-height:1.5}
.ib-text strong{color:var(--green)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header class="header">
  <div class="header-logo">PLAN <span>PAULO</span></div>
  <div class="header-tag">EN PROGRESO</div>
</header>

<!-- SCROLL AREA -->
<main class="scroll-area" id="scrollArea">

  <!-- ── HOME ── -->
  <div class="page active" id="page-home">
    <div class="hero-card">
      <div class="hero-name">PAULO<br><span>24 AÑOS</span></div>
      <div class="hero-sub">84 kg · 170 cm · Recomposición corporal</div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="hstat"><div class="hstat-val c-green">2,100</div><div class="hstat-lbl">kcal/día</div></div>
        <div class="hstat"><div class="hstat-val c-orange">−500</div><div class="hstat-lbl">déficit</div></div>
        <div class="hstat"><div class="hstat-val c-blue">190g</div><div class="hstat-lbl">proteína</div></div>
        <div class="hstat"><div class="hstat-val" style="color:#fff">4 días</div><div class="hstat-lbl">entreno</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="install-banner">
      <div class="ib-icon">📲</div>
      <div class="ib-text"><strong>Instala como app:</strong> en Safari toca "Compartir" → "Añadir a inicio". En Chrome: menú ⋮ → "Añadir a pantalla de inicio".</div>
    </div>

    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Las 5 reglas</div>
    <h2 class="sec-h">GOLDEN RULES</h2>
    <ul class="cklist">
      <li>Come 150–190 g de proteína todos los días, sin excepción</li>
      <li>Entrena con progresión: más peso o reps cada semana</li>
      <li>Sueño de 7–8 h vale más que cualquier suplemento</li>
      <li>La grasa abdominal es la última en irse — sé paciente</li>
      <li>Un día libre por semana no arruina nada si el resto es constante</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="tip" style="margin-top:16px">
      Toca las pestañas de abajo para ver tu menú, entrenamiento, medidas y guía de antojitos.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── NUTRICIÓN ── -->
  <div class="page" id="page-nutri">

    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-lbl">Objetivo/día</div><div class="card-big c-green">2,100</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">kcal</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-lbl">Pérdida est.</div><div class="card-big c-blue">~0.5</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">kg/semana</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="macro-wrap">
      <div class="card-lbl">Macros diarios · 2,100 kcal</div>
      <div class="mbar">
        <div class="mb-p" style="width:36%"></div>
        <div class="mb-c" style="width:40%"></div>
        <div class="mb-f" style="width:24%"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mlegend">
        <div class="mleg-item"><div class="mdot" style="background:var(--green)"></div><span>Proteína</span><span class="mleg-val c-green" style="margin-left:6px">189 g</span><span class="mleg-sub">36%</span></div>
        <div class="mleg-item"><div class="mdot" style="background:var(--orange)"></div><span>Carbohidratos</span><span class="mleg-val c-orange" style="margin-left:6px">210 g</span><span class="mleg-sub">40%</span></div>
        <div class="mleg-item"><div class="mdot" style="background:var(--red)"></div><span>Grasas</span><span class="mleg-val c-red" style="margin-left:6px">56 g</span><span class="mleg-sub">24%</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sec-eyebrow" style="margin-top:20px">Menú · 3 comidas económicas</div>
    <h2 class="sec-h">UN DÍA COMPLETO</h2>

    <div class="menu-card">
      <div class="menu-head">
        <div class="mico mico-g">🍳</div>
        <div class="menu-info">
          <div class="menu-time">Desayuno · 7–8 am</div>
          <div class="menu-name">Huevos + avena + fruta</div>
        </div>
        <div><div class="menu-kcal">680<span class="menu-kcal-sub">kcal</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-body">
        <div class="menu-ing">3 huevos · 80 g avena con agua · 1 plátano o manzana · 1 vaso de agua o leche</div>
        <div class="menu-macros">
          <div class="mm"><strong>45g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">pro</span></div>
          <div class="mm"><strong>75g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">carb</span></div>
          <div class="mm"><strong>18g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">grasas</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-tip">💡 <strong>~$25–35 MXN</strong> · Avena en 3 min microondas</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-card">
      <div class="menu-head">
        <div class="mico mico-o">🍗</div>
        <div class="menu-info">
          <div class="menu-time">Comida · 1–3 pm · la más importante</div>
          <div class="menu-name">Pollo + arroz + frijoles + verdura</div>
        </div>
        <div><div class="menu-kcal">870<span class="menu-kcal-sub">kcal</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-body">
        <div class="menu-ing">200 g pechuga o pierna · 150 g arroz cocido · ½ taza frijoles de olla · ensalada o verdura al gusto</div>
        <div class="menu-macros">
          <div class="mm"><strong>80g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">pro</span></div>
          <div class="mm"><strong>90g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">carb</span></div>
          <div class="mm"><strong>18g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">grasas</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-tip o">💡 <strong>~$40–60 MXN</strong> · Puede ser de fonda o mercado, no tienes que cocinar</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-card">
      <div class="menu-head">
        <div class="mico mico-b">🐟</div>
        <div class="menu-info">
          <div class="menu-time">Cena · 7–9 pm · rápida y ligera</div>
          <div class="menu-name">Atún + tortillas + aguacate</div>
        </div>
        <div><div class="menu-kcal">560<span class="menu-kcal-sub">kcal</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-body">
        <div class="menu-ing">2 latas atún en agua · 3 tortillas maíz · ¼ aguacate · jitomate y cebolla · limón y sal</div>
        <div class="menu-macros">
          <div class="mm"><strong>55g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">pro</span></div>
          <div class="mm"><strong>40g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">carb</span></div>
          <div class="mm"><strong>18g</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted)">grasas</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-tip b">💡 <strong>~$25–40 MXN</strong> · Listo en 5 minutos, sin cocinar</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-total">
      <div><div class="mt-lbl">Total del día</div><div class="mt-sub">~$90–135 MXN</div></div>
      <div><div class="mt-val">2,110</div><div class="mt-macros">180g pro · 205g carb · 54g grasas</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="tip">
      <strong>Si tienes más hambre:</strong> añade un huevo duro extra o una tortilla más. No llegues a la cama con hambre intensa — eso sube el cortisol y dificulta la pérdida de grasa.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── ENTRENO ── -->
  <div class="page" id="page-entreno">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Semana tipo</div>
    <h2 class="sec-h">PLAN DE ENTRENO</h2>

    <div style="background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:4px 16px;margin-bottom:16px">
      <div class="day-row">
        <div class="day-tag c-blue">LUN</div>
        <div class="day-content">
          <div class="day-type">Empuje + Core</div>
          <div class="day-detail">Press banca · Press hombro · Fondos · Extensiones tríceps<br><span style="color:var(--green)">Core:</span> Plancha 3×45s · Ab wheel 3×10</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day-row">
        <div class="day-tag c-green">MAR</div>
        <div class="day-content">
          <div class="day-type">⚽ Fútbol o HIIT</div>
          <div class="day-detail">60 min partido <strong>o</strong> sprints 20s/40s × 10–12 rondas</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day-row">
        <div class="day-tag c-blue">MIÉ</div>
        <div class="day-content">
          <div class="day-type">Jale + Core</div>
          <div class="day-detail">Dominadas · Remo barra · Curl bíceps · Face pulls<br><span style="color:var(--green)">Core:</span> Leg raises 3×15 · Dead bug 3×10</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day-row">
        <div class="day-tag" style="color:var(--muted)">JUE</div>
        <div class="day-content">
          <div class="day-type" style="color:var(--muted)">Descanso activo</div>
          <div class="day-detail">Caminata 30 min o movilidad</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day-row">
        <div class="day-tag c-blue">VIE</div>
        <div class="day-content">
          <div class="day-type">Piernas + Core</div>
          <div class="day-detail">Sentadilla · Peso muerto rumano · Prensa · Zancadas<br><span style="color:var(--green)">Core:</span> Side plank · Mountain climbers</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day-row">
        <div class="day-tag c-green">SÁB</div>
        <div class="day-content">
          <div class="day-type">⚽ Fútbol o Circuito</div>
          <div class="day-detail">Partido <strong>o</strong> 3 rondas: 15 burpees + 20 sentadillas + 15 push-ups + 30s plancha</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day-row">
        <div class="day-tag" style="color:var(--muted)">DOM</div>
        <div class="day-content">
          <div class="day-type" style="color:var(--muted)">Descanso total</div>
          <div class="day-detail">Recuperación, sueño, hidratación</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sec-eyebrow">2× por semana</div>
    <h3 style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:26px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0.03em;margin-bottom:12px">RUTINA DE CORE</h3>
    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Ejercicio</th><th>Series</th><th>Zona</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="td-b">Plancha frontal</td><td>3 × 45–60s</td><td><span class="pill p-g">Estabilidad</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="td-b">Ab wheel</td><td>3 × 10–12</td><td><span class="pill p-o">Recto abd.</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="td-b">Leg raises</td><td>3 × 12–15</td><td><span class="pill p-g">Abd. bajo</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="td-b">Side plank</td><td>2 × 30s</td><td><span class="pill p-b">Oblicuos</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="td-b">Dead bug</td><td>3 × 10</td><td><span class="pill p-g">Core profundo</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="td-b">Mountain climbers</td><td>3 × 20s</td><td><span class="pill p-o">Cardio+core</span></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="tip r">El abdomen lo revela el déficit calórico. El core lo fortalece. La dieta elimina la grasa — no los abdominales.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── PROGRESO ── -->
  <div class="page" id="page-progreso">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Cada semana</div>
    <h2 class="sec-h">MIDE TU AVANCE</h2>

    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-lbl">Báscula</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5">Lunes en ayunas, misma hora, sin ropa.</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-lbl">Fotos</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5">Frente, lateral, espalda. Misma luz.</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px">
      <div class="card-lbl" style="margin-bottom:8px">Medidas cada 2 semanas</div>
      <ul class="cklist">
        <li>Cintura al nivel del ombligo</li>
        <li>Cadera en el punto más ancho</li>
        <li>Pecho cruzando los pezones</li>
        <li>Bíceps contraído</li>
        <li>Muslo en la parte más gruesa</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Qué esperar</div>
    <h3 style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:26px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0.03em;margin-bottom:12px">LÍNEA DE TIEMPO</h3>
    <div class="week-grid">
      <div class="week-card"><div class="week-num">SEM 1–2</div><div class="week-title">Inicio</div><div class="week-desc">−1 a 2 kg (agua). Más energía y claridad.</div></div>
      <div class="week-card"><div class="week-num">SEM 3–4</div><div class="week-title">Primeros cambios</div><div class="week-desc">Cintura −1–2 cm. Ropa más holgada.</div></div>
      <div class="week-card"><div class="week-num">SEM 5–8</div><div class="week-title">Definición</div><div class="week-desc">Músculos más marcados. Cambios claros.</div></div>
      <div class="week-card"><div class="week-num">SEM 8–12</div><div class="week-title">Abdomen plano</div><div class="week-desc">Core visible. Inicio de definición real.</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="tip">Si en 3 semanas no hay cambio en cintura ni en fotos, reduce 100 kcal/día. El peso puede estancarse — lo que manda es la cintura y el espejo.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── ANTOJITOS ── -->
  <div class="page" id="page-antojitos">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Come lo que te gusta</div>
    <h2 class="sec-h">SIN ARRUINAR EL PLAN</h2>

    <div class="tip o" style="margin-bottom:16px">Si comes fuera una vez, las otras comidas del día deben ser proteicas y limpias. No se arruina una semana por una comida.</div>

    <div class="antojo-card">
      <div class="antojo-head"><div class="antojo-name">🌮 Tacos</div><span class="pill p-g">−200 kcal</span></div>
      <div class="antojo-body">3 tacos de tinga/pollo/barbacoa en tortilla de maíz. Sin crema, sin queso extra. Agrega salsa y cebolla.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="antojo-card">
      <div class="antojo-head"><div class="antojo-name">🍔 Hamburguesa</div><span class="pill p-g">−350 kcal</span></div>
      <div class="antojo-body">Sin queso doble. Ensalada en lugar de papas. Pide agua en lugar de refresco — ahorras 200 kcal de golpe.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="antojo-card">
      <div class="antojo-head"><div class="antojo-name">🍕 Pizza</div><span class="pill p-o">−300 kcal</span></div>
      <div class="antojo-body">Máx 2 rebanadas, base delgada, sin doble queso. Come pizza en día de entreno para usar bien los carbos.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="antojo-card">
      <div class="antojo-head"><div class="antojo-name">🍣 Sushi</div><span class="pill p-g">−250 kcal</span></div>
      <div class="antojo-body">8–10 piezas nigiri o sashimi. Evita rolls con crema o tempura. El sashimi es proteína pura — perfecto.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="antojo-card">
      <div class="antojo-head"><div class="antojo-name">🌯 Burrito / Torta</div><span class="pill p-o">−200 kcal</span></div>
      <div class="antojo-body">Elige pechuga, atún o frijoles. Sin mayonesa ni crema. Mitad del pan si viene muy cargado.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="tip" style="margin-top:4px">
      <strong>Mentalidad clave:</strong> el déficit es semanal, no diario. Si un día comes de más, el siguiente comes un poco menos. El promedio de la semana es lo que importa.
    </div>
  </div>

</main>

